  "commit_message": "widgets/07 (i39 WIDGET07-AUDIT-A2): NEW Audit Timeline + Tournament console -- audit-pipeline tier A2 read-only slice\n\nStrictly read-only native WinForms widget (no skill.json), matching the widgets/05-06 pattern. Renders EXISTING\nartifacts only: no model call, no lease held, no pause point; writes nothing outside its own runtime/ dir.\nnon_execution holds; it enables no action.\n\nTOURNAMENT (s2.6): three elimination brackets, each with a machine reconciliation proof -- (A) router\nrouting_stage_trace classification->routing->channel_selection (in-|removed|==out; chain out[n]==in[n+1]);\n(B) selpol raw_retrieval->post_filter->packet (subset + omit-reason per drop); (C) #30 deterministic plan\nvalidation (workers==accepted+deferred+rejected, named conflict checks). PREFLIGHT is labeled s2.6-future.\n\nTIMELINE (s2.1): one wave stitched end-to-end (#30 plan + reports) with #39 episodes + #42 state_version\nchains + graceful batons-absent; deterministic total order over an integer (sort_key,seq) composite;\nculture-stable ISO timestamps; dispatched-vs-reported reconciliation. Holds NO lease -> zero lease-window\nviolations by construction.\n\ni33 sanitization honored (router trace channel-only + timeline events allowlisted; injected cross-ns key /\nepisode body fail closed). Gates: cloud 81/0/3 + on-device -Live incl. the WinForms STA SelfTest. Human\nlive-GUI confirm is an accepted OPEN follow-on (D-0064).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016smZNf4o3qD9grVLp7HsPC\n",
